  'Background color, transparency, the Backstage, the timecode and Onion skins in one panel, also on the Stage right-click menu.': "背景顏色、透明度、後台、時間碼與洋蔥皮集中在一個面板，也可從舞台的右鍵選單使用。",
  'Keyboard Shortcuts editor': "鍵盤快速鍵編輯器", 'Every command with its keys. Change them, and conflicts are moved with a message.': "每個指令與其按鍵。可自由變更，衝突會附訊息處理。",
  'Brush library and blend modes': "筆刷庫與混合模式", '165 original brushes in 19 sets, import of brush files, and 25 blend modes with a true pass-through.': "19 組共 165 支原創筆刷、筆刷檔匯入，以及 25 種含真正穿透的混合模式。",
  'Theater management': "劇院管理", 'Select several movies, rename, duplicate, stack movies into folders and use the right-click menu.': "選取多部影片，重新命名、複製、堆疊成資料夾，並使用右鍵選單。",
  'Round trips': "往返", 'Send the current frame to the form image editor and the whole movie to the form effects editor, and bring them back.': "將目前影格傳送到 form 影像編輯器，將整部影片傳送到 form 效果編輯器，再帶回來。",
  'Groups, masks, Warp and a faster Stage': "群組、遮色片、Warp 與更快的舞台", 'Layer groups and masks': "圖層群組與遮色片",
  'Group Drawing layers, give them opacity and blend modes, and paint masks that hide without erasing.': "將繪圖圖層分組，設定不透明度與混合模式，並繪製只隱藏而不擦除的遮色片。",
  'Flipbook row masks and mini preview': "翻頁動畫列遮色片與迷你預覽", 'Rows can cut the row below them, and a small preview loops beside the strip at the movie rate.': "列可以裁切其下方的列，小型預覽會以影片的影格率在條帶旁循環播放。",
  'Warp and Distort keys': "Warp 與 Distort 關鍵影格", 'Bend a block with a mesh or four corners and key the bend over time.': "以網格或四個角點彎曲區塊，並為彎曲設定隨時間變化的關鍵影格。",
  'Loop the visible region': "循環可見區域", 'Play only the part of the Timeline you can see, with sound restarting at its start.': "只播放時間軸上可見的部分，聲音從起點重新開始。",
  'The Stage and exports draw on the graphics card when it matches the processor path. It is on by default and can be turned off in Preferences.': "當顯示卡的結果與處理器一致時，舞台與輸出會在顯示卡上繪製。預設為開啟，可在偏好設定中關閉。",
  'More export formats, recovery and 30 languages': "更多輸出格式、還原功能與 30 種語言", 'ProRes and HEVC export': "ProRes 與 HEVC 輸出",
  'Export ProRes 422 HQ, ProRes 4444 with transparency and HEVC through the ffmpeg you have installed.': "透過您已安裝的 ffmpeg 輸出 ProRes 422 HQ、含透明度的 ProRes 4444 與 HEVC。", 'Deleted movies and exports stay for 30 days and can be restored.': "已刪除的影片與輸出檔會保留 30 天，可還原。", 'Crash recovery': "當機還原",
  'If the window closes by accident, the next start offers to bring your movie back.': "若視窗意外關閉，下次啟動時會提示找回您的影片。", 'Thirty languages': "三十種語言",
