  'Folders, crop on the canvas, more fonts and sturdier files': "資料夾、畫布上裁切、更多字體和更穩固的檔案", 'Theater folders': "劇院資料夾", 'Movies can be stacked into real folders, and you can hold and carry several movies at once into a folder.': "影片可以疊放進真正的資料夾，還能一次按住並帶著多部影片放入資料夾。",
  'Crop on the canvas': "在畫布上裁切", 'Crop right on the picture in Draw & Paint, with a Flipbook time bar to check the frames as you go.': "在繪製與上色中直接在圖片上裁切，並用翻頁動畫時間列邊做邊檢查各影格。", 'Export brushes, sets and libraries': "匯出筆刷、組合和資源庫", 'Send your brushes, brush sets and whole libraries back out as files to share or keep.': "把筆刷、筆刷組合和整個資源庫匯出為檔案，用於分享或保存。",
  '15 font families': "15 個字體系列", 'Fifteen built-in font families, including Arabic, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Thai and Devanagari.': "內建十五個字體系列，包括阿拉伯文、中文、日文、韓文、泰文和天城文。", 'Video with transparency': "帶透明度的影片", 'Video that has transparency now keeps it on the Stage instead of showing black.': "帶透明度的影片現在會在舞台上保留透明，而不是顯示為黑色。",
