  'Loop range and pen play': "迴圈範圍與筆播放", 'Set a loop range to repeat a part of the movie, and press the pen button to play. A four-finger tap previews the movie.': "設定迴圈範圍以重複影片的一部分，按筆按鈕即可播放。四指輕點可預覽影片。", 'Bring any picture, video or sound in from the Create menu with Insert a file.': "透過建立選單中的插入檔案，匯入任何圖片、影片或聲音。", 'Find movies that were left behind after a crash or a moved folder and bring them back.': "找出當機或資料夾被移動後遺留的影片，並將它們找回。",
  'Safer engine': "更安全的引擎", 'The engine now checks the host and origin of every request, and old movie files load cleanly.': "引擎現在會檢查每個請求的主機和來源，舊的影片檔案也能順利載入。", 'Text, onboarding, export and import formats': "文字、新手引導、匯出和匯入格式", 'Text formatting': "文字格式", 'Style text on the Stage and edit it in place.': "在舞台上設定文字樣式，並就地編輯。",
  'Examples, tour and What\'s New': "範例、導覽和新功能", 'Three example movies, a short tour, this page and an About window help you get started.': "三部範例影片、簡短導覽、本頁和關於視窗幫助你上手。", 'More ways to export': "更多匯出方式", 'A preview window, H.264, HEVC, ProRes and VP9 video as .mp4, .mov or .webm, GIF presets and picture frames in PNG, JPG, TIFF, TGA, BMP and WebP.': "預覽視窗、以 .mp4、.mov 或 .webm 匯出 H.264、HEVC、ProRes 和 VP9 影片、GIF 預設，以及 PNG、JPG、TIFF、TGA、BMP 和 WebP 圖片影格。",
  'More ways to import': "更多匯入方式", 'Open TGA pictures and layered PSD, ORA, KRA and PDN files as Drawings; ProRes video and AIFF, CAF and AC-3 sound are converted by the engine.': "將 TGA 圖片和帶圖層的 PSD、ORA、KRA、PDN 檔案作為繪圖開啟；ProRes 影片和 AIFF、CAF、AC-3 聲音由引擎轉換。", 'A canvas for each Drawing': "每個繪圖都有自己的畫布", 'Every Drawing or Flipbook can have a canvas size of its own.': "每個繪圖或翻頁動畫都可以有獨立的畫布尺寸。",
